  "capture_constraints": [
    "Freeze code, protocol and independent validators before formal release capture.",
    "Serialize every build, test, analysis and capture workload on root; source-only agent work may overlap.",
    "Use identical synthetic input and exact output gates across providers; native POI slide-image and video-poster fixtures remain distinct named inputs.",
    "File inputs are recently written or hash-read before samples: warm positional-file baseline, not a filesystem-cold experiment.",
    "Range inputs use explicit caller adapters, no networking; range size caps returned chunks, fixed delay per nonempty backing read. Sleeping includes OS scheduling overhead, not a calibrated bandwidth or WAN model.",
    "Record open/plan/publication or open/metadata/image-read clocks immediately around APIs. Their sum excludes source construction, copies, sink reservation, observation, checks, corpus gates and drops; it is not full lifecycle latency.",
    "Keep managed budget gauges, cache retention, logical source reads and process RSS separate; cache diagnostics explicitly unavailable when observer owner drops.",
    "Retain returned native image across all package-owner drops and revalidate payload; check final Memory/Objects/Depth zero.",
    "Retain all raw observations; flag every corresponding API-duration/RSS repeat change greater than5percent; do not selectively rerun to suppress noise.",
    "Report empirical p50/p95/p99 and deterministic bootstrap median intervals, with finite-sample and host-background limits.",
    "Portable replay and mutation probes must pass after copied executable cleanup."
  ],
  "scope_limits": [
    "Native cross-copy remains unsupported for inspected unnamed slides; native selected-image lifecycle is a separate operation, not evidence of native cross-copy.",
